# The test suite, including the committed test-only OAuth2 fixture keys
# (tests/Fixtures/oauth): the production image must contain only what
# production runs, and publicly known fixture keys must never be reachable
# from it. The API preflight (app:api:preflight) additionally refuses to
# run when the configured keys match a fixture fingerprint.
tests
**/tests
